cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or report, cite it as below."
title: "Vitamin D3 and Vitamin K2: An Independent Evidence Review and Product Database"
abstract: >-
  A structured review of cholecalciferol and menaquinone supplements, covering
  forms, absorption, bioavailability, bone health, calcium regulation, immune
  function, cardiovascular claims, cancer, mortality, blood testing thresholds,
  dosing, toxicity, medication interactions, D3 plus K2 combinations, product
  quality, certification, and cost per effective dose. Includes reproducible
  datasets and a validation pipeline.
